<h1>Points to Miles Converter</h1>

<div class="direct-answer">
  <strong>Direct Answer:</strong> The <strong>Points to Miles Converter</strong> calculates the exact number of airline miles you will receive from a known bank points balance after rounding down to an integer multiple of the transfer increment, verifying that the transferable total meets the minimum transfer threshold, and applying base transfer ratios (e.g., 1:1, 5:4, 4:3) and promotional bonuses. This tool performs a forward quantity conversion. It differs from the <a href="/en/calculators/transfer-bonus/">Transfer Bonus Calculator</a> (which reverse-calculates how many bank points you need for a target award flight) and the <a href="/en/calculators/points-to-dollars/">Miles to Dollars Calculator</a> (which estimates the monetary cash value of a rewards balance).
</div>

